  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A block slides down a smooth inclined plane from height <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"H\"></span> to height <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"h\"></span>, as shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Assuming no friction, what is the work done by the gravitational force on the block during the motion?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mgx\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mg(H - h)\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mg(H + h)\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mgH\"></span></p></li></ol>"
